{"id":"634193","name":"金针菇参苗拌鸽胸肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/634193/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土人参嫩苗","amount":"1把"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"80g"},{"name":"鸽胸肉","amount":"半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"80g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳泡发好好，洗净。","img":"images/634193/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水，煮开5分钟。","img":"images/634193/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净切丝。","img":"images/634193/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"柳树菇鸽子汤里的鸽胸肉取一块。","img":"images/634193/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撕成小块。","img":"images/634193/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"金针菇洗净。","img":"images/634193/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"冷水下锅，煮开5分钟。","img":"images/634193/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"采的土人参苗。","img":"images/634193/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"洗净，改刀。","img":"images/634193/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放金针菇及烫熟。","img":"images/634193/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"过冷水撰干水分。","img":"images/634193/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放食盐。","img":"images/634193/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放寿司醋。","img":"images/634193/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/634193/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/634193/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}